{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於泰爾的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是關於泰爾的預言：",{"text":"他施的船隻哀號吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為從基提","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"傳來消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說泰爾已被毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房屋和港口都蕩然無存。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海邊的居民，西頓","poem":1},{"noteId":13},{"text":"的商賈啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要靜默無言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的商人飄洋過海，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從大水之上把西曷的糧食、尼羅河邊的農產都運到泰爾。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泰爾成為列國的商埠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西頓啊，你要羞愧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這海上的堡壘啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大海否認你，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我沒有經歷過產痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有生過孩子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也未曾養育過兒女。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人聽見泰爾的消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都感到傷痛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海邊的居民啊，你們要去他施！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要哀號！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這就是你們歷史悠久、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"充滿歡樂的城嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的雙腳曾帶她到遠方居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泰爾曾是封王之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的商賈是王侯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的商人名聞天下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但她如今的遭遇是誰定的？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是萬軍之耶和華定的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為要摧毀因榮華而生的驕傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞辱世上的尊貴者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他施的人民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去你們的田地耕作吧，像在尼羅河沿岸一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為海港已不復存在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華向大海伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使列國震動。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂已下令毀滅迦南的堡壘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂說：「受欺壓的處女西頓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你再也不能歡樂了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起來，逃到基提吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是在那裡你也得不到安寧。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["看看迦勒底人所居之地，這個民族已不復存在！亞述人使它成為野獸出沒之地。他們築起圍城的高臺，摧毀它的宮殿，使它淪為廢墟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"他施的船隻都哀號吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們的堡壘已被摧毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["到那日，泰爾必被遺忘七十年，正好一個王的壽數。七十年之後，泰爾必如妓女之歌所描述的："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"「被遺忘的妓女啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿起琴，走遍全城。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要彈得美妙，多多唱歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好使人再記起你。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["七十年後，耶和華必眷顧泰爾。她必重操舊業，與天下萬國交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["但她得到的利潤和收入不會被積攢或儲存起來，而是要被獻給耶和華，用來供應那些事奉耶和華的人，使他們吃得飽足，穿得精美。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"「基提」就是現在的塞浦路斯。","reference":{"chapter":23,"verse":1}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"先知在本預言中提到西頓，是因為泰爾和西頓都在同一地區，都屬於腓尼基人。","reference":{"chapter":23,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}